01:03:06.346 --> 01:03:07.346
Because that was our life at that moment.

261
01:03:08.346 --> 01:03:10.346
We did everything together with that spirit.

262
01:03:12.346 --> 01:03:17.346
Meanwhile, Kees had also come home from work.

263
01:03:18.346 --> 01:03:19.346
At his wife Agnes's.

264
01:03:20.346 --> 01:03:25.346
And they had gone to pray for us together, for they realized the seriousness of the situation.

265
01:03:26.346 --> 01:03:29.346
And we call upon that spirit again.

266
01:03:30.346 --> 01:03:32.346
I ask that spirit, do you know Kees Loree?

267
01:03:33.346 --> 01:03:34.346
I do not know him.

268
01:03:35.346 --> 01:03:36.346
Kees said yes.

269
01:03:38.346 --> 01:03:43.346
Then we asked, is it good to talk to that Kees?

270
01:03:45.346 --> 01:03:49.346
Realize that Kees and Agnes were praying at that moment.

271
01:03:49.346 --> 01:03:55.346
And I imagine, in the heavenly realms, that spirit was of course just a demon.

272
01:03:56.346 --> 01:03:58.346
That is what I will talk about with you today.

273
01:04:01.346 --> 01:04:06.346
Realize that at that moment, as I imagine it, angels are surrounding them.

274
01:04:07.346 --> 01:04:11.346
Through the prayer of Kees and Agnes, God gives authority to those angels.

275
01:04:12.346 --> 01:04:15.346
They draw their sword, hold it to the throat of that demon.

276
01:04:15.346 --> 01:04:17.346
And they say, you will say yes.

277
01:04:18.346 --> 01:04:20.346
For what is a demon after?

278
01:04:21.346 --> 01:04:23.346
Where does that fear come from?

279
01:04:24.346 --> 01:04:25.346
It wants to destroy me.

280
01:04:26.346 --> 01:04:30.346
So I ask, is it good to talk to Kees?

281
01:04:31.346 --> 01:04:32.346
And that demon said yes.

282
01:04:33.346 --> 01:04:34.346
He couldn't do otherwise.

283
01:04:35.346 --> 01:04:38.346
If he had said no, I wouldn't be standing here now.

284
01:04:39.346 --> 01:04:42.346
And not only not here, but I also wouldn't have been with him.

285
01:04:42.346 --> 01:04:48.346
And not only not here, but I also wouldn't have been with God in heaven, because I didn't know God at all yet.

286
01:04:50.346 --> 01:04:51.346
Hallelujah.

287
01:04:52.346 --> 01:04:53.346
Hallelujah.

288
01:04:55.346 --> 01:05:01.346
Somehow, from that moment on, we also had no need to continue talking to that spirit.

289
01:05:02.346 --> 01:05:05.346
Not somehow, Kees and Agnes were still praying.

290
01:05:06.346 --> 01:05:09.346
We quickly concluded that conversation with the demon.

291
01:05:09.346 --> 01:05:17.346
And the days after, because we were going to make an appointment, only a few days later did we go to his home.

292
01:05:18.346 --> 01:05:20.346
But we did not summon that spirit again. Never again.

293
01:05:21.346 --> 01:05:25.346
That was the last time in my life that I spoke with a demon.

294
01:05:28.346 --> 01:05:31.346
We arrive at Kees and Agnes's home.

295
01:05:32.346 --> 01:05:37.346
They explain that okay, you have now seen that there are supernatural things.

296
01:05:38.346 --> 01:05:41.346
He explained it really well.

297
01:05:42.346 --> 01:05:44.346
He said, okay, so there is a spiritual world.

298
01:05:45.346 --> 01:05:54.346
Could it be, where your fear comes from, that in that spiritual world there are also beings that do not have good intentions towards you?

299
01:05:55.346 --> 01:05:59.346
Even though they have very nice stories about who they are and what they have all experienced.

300
01:05:59.346 --> 01:06:09.346
Could it be that that fear comes from them and that they are out to destroy you, in other words, that they are evil spirits?

301
01:06:10.346 --> 01:06:12.346
That clicked, I understood that.

302
01:06:13.346 --> 01:06:18.346
Then he started explaining, God, Jesus, Holy Spirit, angels, and demons.

303
01:06:19.346 --> 01:06:22.346
And it came to me like, yes, that is it.

304
01:06:23.346 --> 01:06:25.346
I experienced it, I saw it with my own eyes.

305
01:06:26.346 --> 01:06:27.346
That is it.

306
01:06:27.346 --> 01:06:31.346
Then he said, okay, do you want to choose for Jesus?

307
01:06:32.346 --> 01:06:34.346
And I wanted to.

308
01:06:35.346 --> 01:06:37.346
And that girl too.

309
01:06:38.346 --> 01:06:41.346
Then they started to pray our prayer of repentance with us.

310
01:06:41.346 --> 01:06:56.346
Then they began to address the demons that had been tormenting us and had come to dwell in us.

311
01:06:57.346 --> 01:07:04.346
And it was clear that they had come to dwell in us, because as soon as they started praying for us, I began to stomp my legs hard.

312
01:07:05.346 --> 01:07:06.346
For minutes on end.

313
01:07:06.346 --> 01:07:08.346
And with the girl, it was even worse.

314
01:07:09.346 --> 01:07:12.346
Like a wild beast, he started to go crazy.

315
01:07:13.346 --> 01:07:15.346
I swear, I saw it myself.

316
01:07:16.346 --> 01:07:18.346
And at a certain point, it became quiet.

317
01:07:19.346 --> 01:07:23.346
So that the Holy Spirit came to dwell in me.

318
01:07:24.346 --> 01:07:26.346
So wonderfully beautiful.

319
01:07:27.346 --> 01:07:34.346
That peace, that rest after all those weeks of fear and tension and misery, suddenly the peace came.

320
01:07:34.346 --> 01:07:35.346
Absolutely beautiful.

321
01:07:36.346 --> 01:07:38.346
God is so wonderfully good.

322
01:07:39.346 --> 01:07:40.346
Hallelujah.

323
01:07:41.346 --> 01:07:42.346
Hallelujah.

324
01:07:45.346 --> 01:07:46.346
Half a year later.

325
01:07:47.346 --> 01:07:48.346
Half a year later.

326
01:07:53.346 --> 01:07:54.346
I was home alone.

327
01:07:55.346 --> 01:07:59.346
I was watching a film by Billy Graham on the Evangelical Broadcasting.

328
01:07:59.346 --> 01:08:09.346
Billy Graham was a very prominent preacher at that time who attracted hundreds of thousands of people in stadiums to tell about Jesus.

329
01:08:10.346 --> 01:08:14.346
And he also made a number of films, and I was watching one of them.

330
01:08:15.346 --> 01:08:19.346
Then my sister came in with her boyfriend halfway through the film.

331
01:08:20.346 --> 01:08:21.346
So they started watching along.

332
01:08:21.346 --> 01:08:28.346
And after the film, I naturally began to tell them about Jesus and what I had experienced and how amazing Jesus is.

333
01:08:29.346 --> 01:08:35.346
And then at one point I asked them, would you also like to follow Jesus?

334
01:08:36.346 --> 01:08:38.346
And they both wanted to.

335
01:08:40.346 --> 01:08:44.346
So, I had only been converted for half a year.

336
01:08:44.346 --> 01:08:48.346
And I had experienced this whole demonic occurrence.

337
01:08:49.346 --> 01:08:54.346
So I thought it was normal for someone to be converted that you had to cast out demons.

338
01:08:58.346 --> 01:09:01.346
But I made a huge mistake.

339
01:09:02.346 --> 01:09:04.346
That was actually the first thing I was going to do.

340
01:09:05.346 --> 01:09:09.346
Instead of, I made a huge mistake.

341
01:09:09.346 --> 01:09:11.346
That was actually the first thing I was going to do.

342
01:09:12.346 --> 01:09:15.346
Instead of the prayer of repentance.

343
01:09:17.346 --> 01:09:21.346
So, that boy said, I want to get to know Jesus.

344
01:09:22.346 --> 01:09:27.346
So I sat down next to him, laid my hand on him and started to rebuke demons.

345
01:09:29.346 --> 01:09:32.346
Yes, I understand you're laughing about it.

346
01:09:33.346 --> 01:09:34.346
But it's a drama.

347
01:09:34.346 --> 01:09:37.346
Because that boy started to manifest like crazy.

348
01:09:38.346 --> 01:09:42.346
Just like the girl, that friend of mine, he also started going completely wild.

349
01:09:43.346 --> 01:09:47.346
He kicked his feet in all directions, against the coffee table.

350
01:09:48.346 --> 01:09:50.346
It flew through the air, all the glasses broke on the ground.

351
01:09:51.346 --> 01:09:54.346
I'm not exaggerating, it's literally what I experienced.

352
01:09:55.346 --> 01:09:58.346
And I could pray even harder and go wild.

353
01:10:00.346 --> 01:10:02.346
And it didn't work.

354
01:10:02.346 --> 01:10:04.346
And it didn't work.

355
01:10:05.346 --> 01:10:07.346
And I became scared.

356
01:10:08.346 --> 01:10:11.346
And my sister and that friend became terrified.

357
01:10:12.346 --> 01:10:16.346
And then suddenly, we had a large glass sliding door.

358
01:10:17.346 --> 01:10:21.346
Behind us, a sheet of newspaper came.

359
01:10:22.346 --> 01:10:24.346
It came in front of the window.

360
01:10:25.346 --> 01:10:27.346
And it started flapping up and down like this.

361
01:10:28.346 --> 01:10:30.346
As if held by the wind, so was it at that place.

362
01:10:30.346 --> 01:10:33.346
For a minute long. Truly.

363
01:10:35.346 --> 01:10:39.346
And we were scared and prayed and it didn't work.

364
01:10:41.346 --> 01:10:49.346
And eventually, the three of us went to sleep in the same room.

365
01:10:50.346 --> 01:10:55.346
On a little mattress, because we were so terrified that we didn't want to be apart again.

366
01:11:01.346 --> 01:11:05.346
Unfortunately, that is the end of this testimony.

367
01:11:06.346 --> 01:11:10.346
For that demon, which apparently lived in him.

368
01:11:11.346 --> 01:11:14.346
Not everyone has a demon living in them, but sometimes they do.

369
01:11:15.346 --> 01:11:17.346
Was with me, was with this boy too.

370
01:11:18.346 --> 01:11:21.346
And that demon managed to achieve it in that way.

371
01:11:22.346 --> 01:11:26.346
That the boy and my sister are not saved, still not at this moment.

372
01:11:26.346 --> 01:11:29.346
They are so frightened by what happened there.

373
01:11:30.346 --> 01:11:36.346
That they no longer want anything to do with God.

374
01:11:37.346 --> 01:11:47.346
So the big mistake I made was that I, well-intentioned, did not pray with him.

375
01:11:48.346 --> 01:11:53.346
That he asked Jesus, I want to get to know you, will you forgive my sins?

376
01:11:54.346 --> 01:11:58.346
For where is the victory over a demon?

377
01:11:59.346 --> 01:12:02.346
Why did that demon have to get out of my way when Agnes prayed for me?

378
01:12:03.346 --> 01:12:06.346
And that demon did not leave that boy when I prayed for him.

379
01:12:07.346 --> 01:12:08.346
Authority of Jesus.

380
01:12:09.346 --> 01:12:12.346
That is what I want to talk about with you this morning.

381
01:12:15.346 --> 01:12:21.346
This is a subject I could preach about for weeks.

382
01:12:22.346 --> 01:12:26.346
But we will try to cover it in one sermon.

383
01:12:27.346 --> 01:12:31.346
I want to first give a little introduction about where Satan comes from.

384
01:12:32.346 --> 01:12:35.346
And provide an answer to perhaps a few questions that have come to your mind.

385
01:12:36.346 --> 01:12:41.346
But I will go through it very quickly, because the main topic lies in a slightly different area.

386
01:12:42.346 --> 01:12:47.346
So if you can't keep up with my speed or can't remember, that's okay.

387
01:12:48.346 --> 01:12:53.346
Satan, says the Bible, where does he come from?

388
01:12:54.346 --> 01:12:58.346
Satan is a creature of God, he was indeed an angel.

389
01:12:59.346 --> 01:13:02.346
God first created the angels, then created humans.

390
01:13:03.346 --> 01:13:05.346
Satan was an angel, an important angel.

391
01:13:06.346 --> 01:13:09.346
But he became proud, he thought I am better than God.

392
01:13:10.346 --> 01:13:12.346
So he rebelled against God.

393
01:13:12.346 --> 01:13:16.346
And then God said, we are not going to do that.

394
01:13:17.346 --> 01:13:23.346
And a third of the angels thought, we will join Satan.

395
01:13:24.346 --> 01:13:25.346
We will also oppose God.

396
01:13:26.346 --> 01:13:31.346
And Satan, along with a third of all the angels, who at that moment became demons,

397
01:13:32.346 --> 01:13:37.346
was thrown out of heaven and bound to the earth.

398
01:13:37.346 --> 01:13:41.346
That means, if a third of the angels have become demons,

399
01:13:42.346 --> 01:13:44.346
that two thirds of the angels are still angels.

400
01:13:45.346 --> 01:13:48.346
So, there are twice as many angels as demons.

401
01:13:49.346 --> 01:13:53.346
That is something we sometimes forget, about oh demons this and that,

402
01:13:54.346 --> 01:13:56.346
for there are twice as many angels.

403
01:13:59.346 --> 01:14:02.346
Now they are here, around us, we do not see them.

404
01:14:03.346 --> 01:14:06.346
Now they are here, around us, we do not see them.

405
01:14:07.346 --> 01:14:10.346
They are spirits, but they do exist.

406
01:14:11.346 --> 01:14:13.346
Demons are here, angels are here.

407
01:14:14.346 --> 01:14:18.346
But the ultimate fate of demons is not here.

408
01:14:19.346 --> 01:14:21.346
The ultimate fate of demons is hell.

409
01:14:22.346 --> 01:14:24.346
For that, God created hell.

410
01:14:25.346 --> 01:14:26.346
Not for people.

411
01:14:27.346 --> 01:14:31.346
God wants with all His heart for all people to be saved.

412
01:14:32.346 --> 01:14:35.346
That will not happen, because people may choose for themselves where they go.

413
01:14:37.346 --> 01:14:41.346
And if they do not choose God, then they automatically end up in hell.

414
01:14:42.346 --> 01:14:44.346
For hell is actually very simple.

415
01:14:45.346 --> 01:14:48.346
God is the source of all goodness.

416
01:14:49.346 --> 01:14:51.346
Of everything that is beautiful, of everything that is pleasant.

417
01:14:52.346 --> 01:14:58.346
And so, heaven is where God is, with all His splendor, with all His gifts.

418
01:14:59.346 --> 01:15:01.346
And hell is everything where God is not.

419
01:15:02.346 --> 01:15:06.346
Only fear and death and sickness and destruction and misery.

420
01:15:07.346 --> 01:15:10.346
So, that is the fate for the demons.

421
01:15:11.346 --> 01:15:15.346
They choose not to belong to God, okay, then they end up there and then it will happen.

422
01:15:16.346 --> 01:15:19.346
That is also the sentiment for people who say, I do not want to belong to God.

423
01:15:22.346 --> 01:15:27.346
But hell was made for demons, so that is where they will go.

424
01:15:28.346 --> 01:15:31.346
Whether they jump high or low, it will happen.

425
01:15:32.346 --> 01:15:34.346
What is also important is that there is only one devil.

426
01:15:37.346 --> 01:15:41.346
We sometimes say, oh, the devil has attacked me again.

427
01:15:42.346 --> 01:15:45.346
And Tim said it last week, funny enough, to the baptizees.

428
01:15:46.346 --> 01:15:50.346
Be aware that Satan will attack you, because he tries to hold you back,

429
01:15:51.346 --> 01:15:53.346
now that you have taken this step in faith.

430
01:15:54.346 --> 01:15:55.346
But there is only one Satan.

431
01:15:56.346 --> 01:15:59.346
And he can only be in one place at a time.

432
01:15:59.346 --> 01:16:02.346
So it is not at all the case that Satan is bothering me or you.

433
01:16:03.346 --> 01:16:08.346
The chance is extremely small if you are one in 7, 8 billion people,

434
01:16:09.346 --> 01:16:11.346
that he has specifically targeted you.

435
01:16:12.346 --> 01:16:13.346
That is also important.

436
01:16:14.346 --> 01:16:17.346
He can only be in one place at a time.

437
01:16:18.346 --> 01:16:23.346
The devil is also not the equal of God or his great opponent in that sense of,

438
01:16:24.346 --> 01:16:26.346
God is God, he has always existed.

439
01:16:27.346 --> 01:16:28.346
The devil is created.

440
01:16:29.346 --> 01:16:32.346
God is almighty, can do everything, the devil cannot do everything.

441
01:16:33.346 --> 01:16:35.346
God knows everything, the devil does not know everything.

442
01:16:36.346 --> 01:16:40.346
God exists outside of time, the devil is bound by time just like we are.

443
01:16:41.346 --> 01:16:46.346
So he is not at all like, oh, great God and great devil,

444
01:16:47.346 --> 01:16:51.346
and hopefully, or yes, we know that God wins, but still.

445
01:16:52.346 --> 01:16:54.346
We sometimes say, the devil has a flat head,

446
01:16:55.346 --> 01:16:58.346
because in Genesis at the fall into sin God says,

447
01:16:59.346 --> 01:17:04.346
that Jesus crushed the head of the serpent, of the devil.

448
01:17:05.346 --> 01:17:11.346
And yes, he is just an angel, a fallen angel, no more than that.

449
01:17:12.346 --> 01:17:15.346
And yet he sometimes has a lot of power.

450
01:17:15.346 --> 01:17:17.346
We will talk about that in a moment.

451
01:17:19.346 --> 01:17:23.346
Just a few Q&A questions and answers.

452
01:17:25.346 --> 01:17:27.346
Of questions that may have come to your mind.

453
01:17:28.346 --> 01:17:31.346
Do demons exist? Yes, the whole Bible is full of it.

454
01:17:32.346 --> 01:17:38.346
I was shocked myself, but for example, there are dozens of demon expulsions in the Gospels.

455
01:17:38.346 --> 01:17:40.346
Not just a handful, dozens.

456
01:17:41.346 --> 01:17:44.346
Can you talk to the deceased? No.

457
01:17:45.346 --> 01:17:49.346
If you think you are talking to the deceased, you are talking to a demon.

458
01:17:50.346 --> 01:17:52.346
I have done that, they present themselves as the deceased,

459
01:17:53.346 --> 01:17:56.346
but that is not your dad or your grandpa, or I don't know who.

460
01:17:57.346 --> 01:18:00.346
That is just a demon trying to trick you.

461
01:18:01.346 --> 01:18:03.346
Is there a responsibility?

462
01:18:03.346 --> 01:18:06.346
That is just a demon trying to fool you.

463
01:18:08.346 --> 01:18:13.346
Is summoning spirits with a Ouija board or a pendulum or such things dangerous?

464
01:18:14.346 --> 01:18:16.346
Yes, I was almost dead.

465
01:18:17.346 --> 01:18:19.346
Life is dangerous, don't do it.

466
01:18:20.346 --> 01:18:22.346
Can demons just do what they want?

467
01:18:23.346 --> 01:18:25.346
And where do they get their power from?

468
01:18:26.346 --> 01:18:27.346
Yes and no.

469
01:18:28.346 --> 01:18:30.346
Their power comes when people give it to them.

470
01:18:30.346 --> 01:18:33.346
They have no power, but when people give them power,

471
01:18:34.346 --> 01:18:36.346
they have a lot of power over those people.

472
01:18:37.346 --> 01:18:40.346
Not over me, not over you if you are in Jesus.

473
01:18:41.346 --> 01:18:43.346
Can a demon inhabit someone?

474
01:18:44.346 --> 01:18:46.346
Yes, I have experienced that myself.

475
01:18:47.346 --> 01:18:51.346
But we are not playthings of the devil.

476
01:18:52.346 --> 01:18:55.346
Through Jesus, we will talk about that too,

477
01:18:55.346 --> 01:18:59.346
we have complete victory over every demon.

478
01:19:03.346 --> 01:19:08.346
So if you walk around with, oh, I have so much struggle in my life

479
01:19:09.346 --> 01:19:11.346
and the devil always attacks me.

480
01:19:12.346 --> 01:19:13.346
Then something is wrong.

481
01:19:14.346 --> 01:19:16.346
Vanessa said a few weeks ago,

482
01:19:17.346 --> 01:19:21.346
if you keep thinking that the devil is attacking you, then you are probably living in sin.

483
01:19:22.346 --> 01:19:24.346
Then you need to examine yourself with the Holy Spirit

484
01:19:25.346 --> 01:19:29.346
to see what is going on, because the devil has no right at all

485
01:19:29.346 --> 01:19:32.346
to constantly and constantly and constantly attack you.

486
01:19:35.346 --> 01:19:37.346
Should demons listen to us?

487
01:19:38.346 --> 01:19:42.346
If Jesus speaks through us, then yes, otherwise no.

488
01:19:44.346 --> 01:19:47.346
Can anyone cast out demons? Same story.

489
01:19:48.346 --> 01:19:50.346
Can demons read thoughts?

490
01:19:51.346 --> 01:19:56.346
Maybe, the Bible actually doesn't say anything clear about that.

491
01:19:57.346 --> 01:19:59.346
And I love to let the Bible speak.

492
01:20:00.346 --> 01:20:03.346
We can hang all sorts of theories on these kinds of things,

493
01:20:04.346 --> 01:20:07.346
but in my opinion, that is not very important.

494
01:20:08.346 --> 01:20:12.346
Same, can demons speak in our thoughts?

495
01:20:13.346 --> 01:20:15.346
Maybe, the Bible doesn't say anything clearly about that either.

496
01:20:16.346 --> 01:20:20.346
I at least think that for example nightmares

497
01:20:21.346 --> 01:20:25.346
can really be inspired by demons in your head.

498
01:20:26.346 --> 01:20:30.346
But it is not very important, because there are all sorts of voices in your head

499
01:20:31.346 --> 01:20:32.346
that are against you.

500
01:20:33.346 --> 01:20:35.346
Your own flesh tries to keep you away from God.

501
01:20:36.346 --> 01:20:38.346
